Based on OpenLauncher
---------------------

LunoLauncher is a modified version (fork) of the OpenLauncher project.

  Original work : OpenLauncher — a decentralized Minecraft launcher, licensed GPL-3.0.
                  The build this fork is based on was obtained from the public
                  distribution page https://honghemc.cn/openlauncher/ (a community
                  download/collection page, not the copyright holder).
  Modifications : rebranded as LunoLauncher; independent update channel and signing
                  key; own website, release process and privacy policy; a reworked
                  co-op ("联机") feature; EasyTier bundled into the exe (0.3.1). No
                  changes were made to the authentication protocol or to the
                  endpoint usage.
  Dates          : fork + rebrand 2026-10-24; modern UI/theme 2026-10-27;
                   co-op rooms 2026-10-27; bundled EasyTier 2026-10-27.

