Bundled third-party components
------------------------------

The distributed LunoLauncher.exe embeds the following *unmodified* official binaries so
that co-op works out of the box (one exe to send to a friend). They are unpacked into the
data directory on first use and executed as separate processes; none of them is linked
into the launcher's own code (mere aggregation). Full license texts are embedded in the
application ("第三方组件与许可") and are also kept under src/LunoLauncher/Assets/licenses/.

  EasyTier 2.6.4 — easytier-core.exe, easytier-cli.exe
    License  : GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0)
    Copyright: EasyTier contributors
    Source   : https://github.com/EasyTier/EasyTier (tag v2.6.4)
    Replaceable: 联机 → 房间设置 → EasyTier 目录 (point it at your own build)

