               software that uses it only via the permitted API is allowed by clause 3(d)
    Source   : https://www.wintun.net/
    Unmodified: this license forbids modifying the DLL


Bundled Microsoft application (Client ID)
-----------------------------------------

Official binaries are built with the maintainer's own Azure application, which has been
approved by Mojang for the Minecraft API. The Client ID is NOT part of this source code:
it is injected at build time (see README). Building this project from source therefore
produces a launcher with no Client ID, which cannot sign anyone in until you register and
get your own application approved at https://aka.ms/mce-reviewappid.

The embedded application is granted for use by this launcher only. Do not extract it and
reuse it in another program: it is a public-client identifier, so it cannot be kept secret,
and any abuse is attributed to the registered application rather than to whoever used it.

